# Telco Customer Churn — Exploratory Data Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview

This project explores customer churn in the telecommunications industry using Python. The goal is to understand customer behaviour and identify patterns associated with customers leaving the service.

## 🎯 Objectives

* Analyse customer churn distribution.
* Explore customer tenure and contract types.
* Understand the relationship between payment methods, billing, and churn.
* Identify patterns through data visualisation.

## 📂 Dataset

The dataset used in this project was obtained from Kaggle.

* **Dataset:** Telco Customer Churn
* **Source:** [Kaggle — Telco Customer Churn Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/blastchar/telco-customer-churn)
* **File:** `WA_Fn-UseC_-Telco-Customer-Churn.csv`

The dataset contains customer information, subscribed services, contract details, billing information, and churn status.

## 🛠️ Tools and Technologies

* Python
* Pandas
