## 🔍 Analysis Performed

* Data inspection and cleaning
* Duplicate record handling
* Churn distribution analysis
* Key Performance Indicator (KPI) calculations
* Customer tenure and contract analysis
* Payment method and billing analysis
* Data visualisation and correlation analysis

## 📊 Key Insights

The analysis explores patterns between customer churn and factors such as tenure, contract type, payment method, and billing.

Refer to the notebook for the detailed findings and visualisations.

## 🚀 How to Run

1. Clone or download this repository.

2. Download the dataset from the [Kaggle dataset page](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/blastchar/telco-customer-churn).

3. Install the required libraries:

   ```bash
   pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn jupyter
   ```

4. Open the notebook in Jupyter Notebook.

5. Update the dataset path if necessary.

6. Run the notebook cells sequentially.

